{"id":"n48855-1-9","stage":4,"title":"동감 · 同感","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48855-1-9-1","ko":"그 사람의 주장에 전적으로 동감을 하시나요?","zh":"您完全同意那个人的观点吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람의","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주장에","meaning":"主张","explanation":"주장：主张；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주장","audio":"/audio/5d52129144d1242334e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25973","senseId":"1","lemma":"주장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전적으로","meaning":"全的，所有的","explanation":"전적：全的，所有的；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"전적","audio":"/audio/cbac60f1a6c1c8df2a95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74516","senseId":"1","lemma":"전적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동감을","meaning":"同感，共鸣","explanation":"동감：同感，共鸣；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"동감","audio":"/audio/b16bf48f197c3a19a5af.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48855","senseId":"1","lemma":"동감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시나요?","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"5d52129144d12423","term":"주장","zh":"主张","audio":"/audio/5d52129144d1242334e5.mp3","entryId":"25973","definition":"坚定地推出自己的意见或信念；或指那样的意见或信念。","pronunciation":["주장"]},{"id":"cbac60f1a6c1c8df","term":"전적","zh":"全的，所有的","audio":"/audio/cbac60f1a6c1c8df2a95.mp3","entryId":"74516","definition":"没有一个漏掉，全部的。","pronunciation":["전쩍"]},{"id":"b16bf48f197c3a19","term":"동감","zh":"同感，共鸣","audio":"/audio/b16bf48f197c3a19a5af.mp3","entryId":"48855","definition":"对于某个意见有着相同的想法；或指该想法。","pronunciation":["동감"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进食或抽烟等。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/82d23cc1516f74e554f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48855-1-9-2","ko":"네. 평소 제 생각과 같거든요.","zh":"是的，因为那和我的平常想法是一样的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평소","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각과","meaning":"想法，念头，心思","explanation":"생각：想法，念头，心思；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"5","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같거든요.","meaning":"相同，一样，一致","explanation":"같다：相同，一样，一致；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[